songshu-060-wangzhunzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi-ws1996694","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p001","quote":"王准之字元曾，琅邪臨沂人。高祖彬，尚書僕射。曾祖彪之，尚書令。祖臨之，父訥之，並御史中丞。彪之博聞多識，練悉朝儀，自是家世相傳，並諳江左舊事，緘之青箱，世人謂之「王氏青箱學」。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p001:m0036"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所載官名，任期無確切年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-song060-wangzhunzhi-75-128-訥","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBA","title":"御史中丞","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-song060-wangzhunzhi-75-128-訥:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002","start":128,"end":132,"surface":"御史中丞","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0142","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-060","chapter_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi-ws1996694","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002","quote":"准之兼明禮傳，贍於文辭。起家為本國右常侍，桓玄大將軍行參軍。玄篡位，以為尚書祠部郎。義熙初，又為尚書中兵郎，遷參高祖車騎中軍軍事，丹陽丞，中軍太尉主簿，出為山陰令，有能名。預討盧循功，封都亭侯。又為高祖鎮西、平北、太尉參軍，尚書左丞，本郡大中正。宋臺建，除御史中丞，為僚友所憚。准之父訥之、祖臨之、曾祖彪之至准之，四世居此職。准之嘗作五言，范泰謿之曰：「卿唯解彈事耳。」准之正色答：「猶差卿世載雄狐。」坐世子右衞率謝靈運殺人不舉免官。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0142"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本句所載官名，任期無確切年月。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p001","text":"王准之字元曾，琅邪臨沂人。高祖彬，尚書僕射。曾祖彪之，尚書令。祖臨之，父訥之，並御史中丞。彪之博聞多識，練悉朝儀，自是家世相傳，並諳江左舊事，緘之青箱，世人謂之「王氏青箱學」。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface"